@page "/privacy"
@layout Layout.MainLayout

<PageTitle>Privacy Policy — LinkNest</PageTitle>

<div class="ln-page" style="max-width: 42rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: var(--ln-space-6) var(--ln-space-4);">
    <header class="ln-page-head">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="ln-muted">Last updated: July 2026</p>
    </header>

    <section class="ln-panel ln-privacy">
        <p>
            LinkNest helps you save and organize links in categories, optionally share collections with small groups,
            and manage favorites and archives. This policy describes what we collect and why.
        </p>

        <h2 class="ln-panel__title">Information we collect</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Account data:</strong> email address, display name, and password (stored hashed).</li>
            <li><strong>Content you save:</strong> category names, link titles, URLs, optional notes, and link preview metadata fetched from public URLs.</li>
            <li><strong>Group data:</strong> group names, membership, and invites when you use shared collections.</li>
            <li><strong>Preferences:</strong> language choice (English or Arabic) and UI settings.</li>
            <li><strong>Technical data:</strong> standard server logs (IP address, browser type, timestamps) for security and troubleshooting.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="ln-panel__title">How we use information</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Provide authentication, sync your data across devices, and operate shared groups.</li>
            <li>Send transactional email (account confirmation, password reset) when you request it.</li>
            <li>Protect the service against abuse (rate limiting, fraud prevention).</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="ln-panel__title">What we do not do</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>We do not sell your personal information.</li>
            <li>We do not use your saved links for advertising profiles.</li>
            <li>We do not send marketing email unless you opt in separately (not offered in v1).</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="ln-panel__title">Sharing</h2>
        <p>
            Content you mark as shared is visible to members of that group. Private categories and links remain visible
            only to your account. We may use infrastructure providers (hosting, database, email delivery) who process data
            on our behalf under contractual obligations.
        </p>

        <h2 class="ln-panel__title">Retention &amp; deletion</h2>
        <p>
            Your data is kept while your account is active. Archived items are purged after the retention period shown
            in the app. You may deactivate your account from Settings; your saved content may remain stored per product
            rules but your login is disabled.
        </p>

        <h2 class="ln-panel__title">Security</h2>
        <p>
            Passwords are hashed. Production deployments use HTTPS. Access to shared group content requires authentication
            and group membership.
        </p>

        <h2 class="ln-panel__title">Contact</h2>
        <p>
            For privacy questions, contact the operator of this LinkNest instance at the support email published with
            your deployment.
        </p>

        <div class="ln-auth-actions" style="margin-top: var(--ln-space-5)">
            <a class="ln-btn ln-btn--ghost ln-btn--block" href="/">Back to LinkNest</a>
        </div>
    </section>
</div>

<style>
    .ln-privacy ul {
        margin: 0 0 var(--ln-space-4);
        padding-inline-start: var(--ln-space-5);
        color: var(--ln-text-muted);
        line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .ln-privacy li + li {
        margin-top: var(--ln-space-2);
    }

    .ln-privacy p {
        color: var(--ln-text-muted);
        line-height: 1.55;
    }
</style>
